---
import SocialLinks from "./SocialLinks.astro";
import NailongEasterEgg from "./NailongEasterEgg.astro";
---

<section id="top" class="pt-12 sm:pt-16">
  <h1 class="reveal reveal-1 font-sans text-[1.08rem] font-medium text-ink">
    hey, i'm elsa.
  </h1>

  <div
    class="reveal reveal-2 body mt-4 max-w-[40rem] space-y-4 text-[1.08rem] text-muted"
  >
    <p>
      20, dropped outta usc. not to "chase my dreams," exactly, but to chase a
      kind of freedom i've always wanted.
    </p>
    <p>
      currently head of growth & creative director @<a
        href="https://ditto.ai"
        class="link-accent"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">ditto</a
      >, a $10m backed consumer social + matchmaking agent for gen z like me.
    </p>
    <p>
      been in this company for about a year. No prev startup experiences but I'm
      a strong believer that the next operating system for getting things done
      will be built around conversation, with AI agents serving as the execution
      layer.
    </p>
    <p>
      started on the creative side, then drifted into execution, strategy,
      building. i don't really believe in staying in one lane. honestly i'm just
      curious as fuck about how everything actually works, and how people think,
      so i'd rather stay fluid and sit at the intersection of all of it, wherever
      the most interesting things are happening.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="reveal reveal-3 mt-7 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-2">
    <SocialLinks />
    <NailongEasterEgg />
  </div>
</section>
